OL,3,GNEWSADecision delayed on #85m
OL,4,ASedgefield defence plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on whether an #85m satellite
OL,7,Ffactory will be built in County Durham
OL,8,Fhas been delayed.
OL,10,FLockheed Martin wants to make military
OL,11,Fsatellites as part of the government's
OL,12,FSkynet 6 programme at NETpark in
OL,13,FSedgefield, creating 500 jobs.
OL,15,FBut a preferred bidder is yet to be
OL,16,Fchosen by the government, with
OL,17,Fcompanies involved given more time to
OL,18,Fmake submissions.
OL,20,FAirbus Defence and Space UK has a rival
OL,21,Fbid to develop the technology in the
OL,22,FSouth of England.
